        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "",
          "end": "join"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "The Manuscripts collated are the following .—",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "S. A very neatly and beautifully written copy with a com",
          "end": "join"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "mentary, in the collection of MSS. deposited in Elphinstone",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "College, and belonging to the Government of Bombay. It is fairly",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "correct, and the slips it contains are on the whole easy of de-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "tection as well as rectification.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "W. A second Manuscript, also with a commentary, in the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "same collection, written in very big letters. It is much less care",
          "end": "join"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "fully written and contains numerous slips.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "L. A third, also in the same collection, also accompanied by",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "a commentary. It is far inferior to both of the preceding ones",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "in caligraphy. It is only less full of errors than W.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "X. A copy from Nassick with a commentary clearly written",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "out. This was lent me by my friend Mr. Bhagvant Mangesh",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "Wâgle. It is tolerably correct though there are some slips.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "D. A copy belonging to a Guzerâthi friend who lent it me.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "This contains only the text, and is ill written. It abounds in",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "erroneous copying.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "F. A fragment of a MS. of the text only, lent me by my",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "friend Mr. Abâji V. Kâthavaṭe, B. A. It contains only about ten",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "Stanzas. It comes immediately from Puna.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "G. An incomplete MS. of text and commentary from Ahme-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "dabad procured for me by my friend Mr. Ambâlâl Sâkarlâl De-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "sai, M.A., LL.B. It contains a good many slips, and the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "structure of the letters is not correct in some places.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "M. A neatly written MS. with a commentary. This was lent",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "me by my friend Mr. Râmchandra Bhikâjî Gunjikar. The Ma-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "nuscript is from Belgaum. The writing is bold and clear, but",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "there are little slips now and then about double letters, visargas,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "etc. Barring these it is a correct MS.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
